      <section class="git-how-intro"><strong>${word("The one-sentence version","The short version")}</strong><p>${word("You work in a folder on your computer. Every so often you record a version — a snapshot you can return to. When you’re ready, you upload those versions so teammates can get them, and download the versions they upload.","You edit a working tree, stage changes, and create commits on a branch. Push commits to an upstream remote and pull commits created by collaborators.")}</p></section>
